{"title":"Fungi Finds","slug":"Fungi_Finds","hero":{"file":"Fungi_Finds.webp","width":400,"height":191},"pageid":747,"revid":15262,"timestamp":"2024-10-13T11:16:44Z","lastEditor":"Fixer2285","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater, Uncertainty Cave"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Mushroo"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Shop"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Music","value":"[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MkljsMZ26e0 Kevin MacLeod - Townie Loop]"}]},"sections":[{"id":"items","text":"Items"}],"body":"<p><br>\nFungi Finds is a shop found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave/\">Uncertainty</a>. The shopkeeper, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mushroo/\">Spore Mushroo</a>, sells items such as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dice/\">Dice</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup/\">Mysterious Teacups</a>, and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Kallostide/\">Kallostide</a>. The shop can be found by exploding the breakable wall found near the possible pirate ship spawn further back into the Uncertainty Cave. Note that there is a wall blocking off access to this area, which will require being removed using explosives. (2 3x dynamite works, for example.)\n</p><p>Note: (No, this area wasn't removed in the map revamp. It was just moved and hidden, like other parts of the game.)\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The outside of Fungi Finds\">The outside of Fungi Finds</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Fungi_Finds_Entrance.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The outside of Fungi Finds</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p> When finding the entrance, find the entrance to the fusion coil cave and keep heading forward until you find a random piller\n</p><h2 id=\"items\">Items</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dice/\">Dice</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dice Boxed\">Dice Boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$2,150\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mysterious_Teacup/\">Mysterious Teacup</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Mysterious Teacup\">Mysterious Teacup</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$6,704\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Kallostide/\">Kallostide</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Kallostide\">Kallostide</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$8,400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dark_Alley/\">Dark Alley</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dark Alley\">Dark Alley</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dusk_and_Dawn/\">Dusk and Dawn</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dusk and Dawn\">Dusk and Dawn</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ol'_Night/\">Ol'Night</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ol' Night\">Ol' Night</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moai/\">Moai</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Moaihighres\">Moaihighres</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$12,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
